      "text": "### Playwright: DOM Interaction (POST /customer/orders (voucherCode))\n\nTạo đơn 50.000 đ kèm voucher TBQA_MIN50001 / TBQA_EXPIRED\n\n- Route: POST /customer/orders (voucherCode)\n- Console Error: None\n- Artifact: N/A",
